# Reference sources

When designing or implementing SkiaUi (layout, input, XAML, rendering), consult these public repositories. Prefer patterns that fit `SkUiContentView` → `ISkUiView`; do not copy frameworks wholesale. Details live in `Requirements.md`.

**Layout contract:** use **.NET MAUI** measure/arrange and layout managers (not Flutter box constraints) so SkiaUi can drop-in-replace MAUI controls/layouts.

| Framework | URL |
| --- | --- |
| .NET MAUI | https://github.com/dotnet/maui |
| Open-Maui | https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux |
| Flutter | https://github.com/flutter/flutter |
| Avalonia | https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia |
| Uno Platform | https://github.com/unoplatform/uno |
| DrawnUi (MAUI) | https://github.com/taublast/drawnui |
| SkiaSharp | https://github.com/mono/SkiaSharp |
